WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
Tools occupy different assurance layers.
Test-asset tools need validation

00:00:03.973 --> 00:00:08.640
of the resulting tests. Coding assistants
need review of issues found and missed.

00:00:08.749 --> 00:00:12.080
Evaluation platforms
need suitable datasets,

00:00:12.124 --> 00:00:14.720
calibrated judgments
and exportable evidence.

00:00:15.013 --> 00:00:19.000
Adversarial tools need coverage
of the actual authority boundary.

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:21.760
The examples are
representative documentation,

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:25.040
not an independent product
ranking. Select tools against

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:28.160
the client's workflow and the proof
each layer must produce.
